For this project, we were given three different data sets that would help us evaluate the environmental efficiency of transit agencies in the United States.

Energy Information Administration (EIA) State Electricity Profiles (EIA_SEP_REPORT):Examines the level of electrical grid carbon, the retail prices for electricity, and the total capacity generation.
National Transit Database (NTD) 2025 Energy Consumption (NTD_ENERGY):Takes a look at the annual fuel as well as the total electrical energy used across various modes when reporting the transit agency of the United States.
National Transit Database (NTD) 2025 Service Provided (NTD_SERVICE): Shows the annual ridership using passenger trips, total passenger miles, and demographics for the service area.





